id: pm-starter-sdk-adoption-1025
title: Use SDK-certified complete reads in starter commands and exports
description: "Replace the audited full-list subprocess and local completeness policy with host listAllComplete and SDK envelope certification; retain failed-read outcomes and integrity refusal. Related prior SDK adoption: pm-starter-fafo; portable host SDK examples: pm-starter-labs."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T17:57:48.894Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-25T18:13:26.207Z"
author: codex-agent
